  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業實習",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是提供學生進入相關產業實習的機會，目的在加強商業知識及經濟理論與實務的結合，並強化學生的就業專業技能，藉此提升未來的競爭能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The Industrial Internship Program was designed to offer students a value-added opportunity to include work experience as part of their program of study. This program helps students to integrate business/ economics theory and practice ,and moreover, strengthen students’ professional skills and the job competitiveness.",
